  "title": "The First Bancorp Announces First Quarter Results",
  "summary": "Net Interest Margin Expansion and Improved Efficiency Drive a 27% Increase in First Quarter Earnings The First Bancorp (Nasdaq: FNLC), (\"the Company\", \"we\", \"us\", \"our\"), parent company of First National Bank, today reported unaudited results for the quarter ended March 31, 2026. Net income for the period was $9.0 million with fully diluted earnings per share of $0.80, as compared to net income of $7.1 million and diluted earnings per share of $0.63 for the three months ended March 31, 2025. Fir",
